# Cloudflare Pages Redirects
# yeslon.com → www.yeslon.com (SEO canonical)
https://yeslon.com/*  https://www.yeslon.com/:splat  301

# 子域名 → 路径前缀（统一入口，避免子域名访问失败）
https://energy.yeslon.com/*  https://www.yeslon.com/energy/:splat  301
https://electrical-safety.yeslon.com/*  https://www.yeslon.com/electrical-safety/:splat  301
https://lightning-protection.yeslon.com/*  https://www.yeslon.com/lightning-protection/:splat  301
https://industrial-plc.yeslon.com/*  https://www.yeslon.com/industrial-plc/:splat  301

# 未建设的子域名 → 主站（避免 DNS 已配但无内容导致 404）
https://agriculture.yeslon.com/*  https://www.yeslon.com/  301
https://healthcare.yeslon.com/*  https://www.yeslon.com/  301
https://logistics.yeslon.com/*  https://www.yeslon.com/  301
https://manufacturing.yeslon.com/*  https://www.yeslon.com/  301

# Baidu verification - prevent .html stripping redirect
/baidu_verify_codeva-Gw7FVtUTBA.html  /baidu_verify_codeva-Gw7FVtUTBA.html  200

# Static assets - serve directly (prevents 404 from catching .css/.js/etc)
/*.*  /:splat  200

# Custom 404 - only for routes without file extensions
/*  /404.html  404
